  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Red Hat OpenShift support for OpenShift 4.8&nbsp;is now generally available. This release uses&nbsp;<a href=\"https://v1-21.docs.kubernetes.io/docs/setup/release/notes/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kubernetes 1.21</a>&nbsp;with CRI-O runtime.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about&nbsp;<a href=\"https://docs.openshift.com/container-platform/4.8/release_notes/ocp-4-8-release-notes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenShift 4.8</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Learn more about the <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/openshift/support-lifecycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Red Hat OpenShift release schedule</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Red Hat OpenShift support for OpenShift 4.8 is now generally available. This release uses Kubernetes 1.21 with CRI-O runtime.\n\nLearn more about OpenShift 4.8 .\n\nLearn more about the Azure Red Hat OpenShift release schedule ."
  },
